<div style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a;">
<p>Hello <strong>{{.Invitee}}</strong>,</p>
<p><strong>{{.Inviter}}</strong> has invited you to join the family <strong>{{.Family}}</strong> on MMFamily.</p>
<p>Open the link below on your profile page to review and accept or decline:</p>
<p><a href="{{.ProfileLink}}" style="color:#0066cc;word-break:break-all;">{{.ProfileLink}}</a></p>
<p style="color:#666;font-size:13px;">If you were not expecting this invitation, you can ignore this message.</p>
</div>
